Package: prerelation
Type: Package
Title: The Prerelation Coefficient and Its Directional Scan
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jaehwa", "Choi", email = "jaehwa.f.choi@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A base-R implementation of the prerelation coefficient
    Pi(X -> Y) = A1 * A2 on a common anchored [0, 1] scale, the prerelation
    direction coefficient Delta = Pi(X -> Y) - Pi(Y -> X), the permutation
    test, and the pairwise dominance scan with Benjamini-Hochberg control,
    cycle detection, transitive reduction and equivalence-class
    condensation. What the scan recovers is a dominance preorder over the
    attributes, not a direct-prerequisite acyclic graph. The package is a
    port of the Python reference implementation and is pinned to its
    committed golden vectors; it uses no packages outside base R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
